["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意向</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意向；意愿；想法；看法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143104\"><ruby>政府<rp>(</rp><rt>せいふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>減税<rp>(</rp><rt>げんぜい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>意向<rp>(</rp><rt>いこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>明言<rp>(</rp><rt>めいげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">政府提出了减税的意图。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">移行</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">过渡；转换；切换；转变；（权力、重量等的）转移；（重心等的）移动</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">イコール</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">相等的；等同的；等号；等于号；等于（如“A等于B”）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">以後</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">此后；从今以后；今后；其后；自那时起；此后</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191217\"><ruby>以後<rp>(</rp><rt>いご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こんなことはいたしません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">以后我不会这样做。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">勇ましい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いさましい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">勇敢；英勇；无畏；振奋；雄壮；激励人心</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74800\"><ruby>一人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>原始林<rp>(</rp><rt>げんしりん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>乗<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もうとは<ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はなんて<ruby>勇<rp>(</rp><rt>いさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ましいんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你是多么勇敢自己走进原始森林。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いざ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">现在；来吧；好吧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229133\">いざ<ruby>投票<rp>(</rp><rt>とうひょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>という<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>棄権<rp>(</rp><rt>きけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在投票时,他拒绝了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">医師</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">医生；医师</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110078\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>医師<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になるために<ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他正在学习成为医生。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意志</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意志；意愿；决心</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"156183\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>辞職<rp>(</rp><rt>じしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>意志<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまったくない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我一点也没有要辞职的意思。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/461610\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意思</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意图；愿望；目的；心意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144288\"><ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>互<rp>(</rp><rt>たが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>言葉<rp>(</rp><rt>ことば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>意思<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>つう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じ<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">人们互相说话,互相说话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">石</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">石头；岩石；卵石；宝石；珠宝；打火石；棋子；围棋子；黑白棋子；结石；（膀胱、肾脏等的）结石</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"164717\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはこの<ruby>石<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がらない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不能把这块石头拿起来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意識</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いしき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意识；知觉状态；意识到；察觉；感知；意识（佛教用语，六识之一，指对感觉信息进行认知的心识）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223927\">このお<ruby>料理<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、パリのエスプリを<ruby>意識<rp>(</rp><rt>いしき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して、<ruby>味付<rp>(</rp><rt>あじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けしてみました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个菜,我认识到巴黎的埃斯普里,尝试了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">碑</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いしぶみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">刻有铭文的石碑（尤指为后世而立的纪念碑）；石碑；纪念碑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">医者</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いしゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">医生；医师</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"190904\"><ruby>医者<rp>(</rp><rt>いしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になるつもりだったのですが。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我想成为医生。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">衣装</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">衣服；服装；戏装；衣着</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90800\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>花嫁<rp>(</rp><rt>はなよめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のような<ruby>衣装<rp>(</rp><rt>いしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她穿着像新娘一样的衣服。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">衣食住</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いしょくじゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">衣食住；生活必需品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168553\"><ruby>子供<rp>(</rp><rt>こども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>衣食住<rp>(</rp><rt>いしょくじゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>親<rp>(</rp><rt>おや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>依存<rp>(</rp><rt>いぞん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">孩子们依赖父母的食物生活。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意地</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">固执；倔强；意志力；自尊心；性格；脾气；禀性；食欲；欲望；贪心</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74706\">みかけはそうではないのに<ruby>本当<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>意地<rp>(</rp><rt>いじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看不出是这样,但真的不好意思。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">維持</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">维持</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>健康<rp>(</rp><rt>けんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>維持<rp>(</rp><rt>いじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するには<ruby>運動<rp>(</rp><rt>うんどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>欠<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かせない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">要维持健康，运动不可缺少。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n2/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">維</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いじめる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">欺凌；欺负；折磨；嘲弄；残害；迫害；苛待；严苛对待</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110371\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はよく<ruby>友人<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をいじめたものだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他经常打扰朋友。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">移住</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いじゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">迁居；移居；移民</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"98220\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らはアメリカに<ruby>移住<rp>(</rp><rt>いじゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するつもりです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们打算移民到美国。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">以上</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">不少于……；……以上；……及以上；……或更多；超出（如超出预期）；超越；多于；进一步；上述；上述的；前述；前面提到的；既然……；由于……；既然如此；一旦……；仅此而已；到此为止；结束</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191216\"><ruby>以上<rp>(</rp><rt>いじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">是以上吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">異常</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">异常；不寻常；非凡；罕见</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204297\">そんなにたくさん<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べるのは<ruby>異常<rp>(</rp><rt>いじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">吃得这么多是不平凡的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">弄る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いじる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">用手指触摸；玩弄；摆弄；改动；调整；篡改；业余从事；作为爱好玩弄；随意尝试；嘲弄；取笑；戏弄</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147400\"><ruby>書類<rp>(</rp><rt>しょるい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>勝手<rp>(</rp><rt>かって</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にいじられた<ruby>形跡<rp>(</rp><rt>けいせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">文件本身是被打破的迹象。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意地悪</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いじわる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恶意的；脾气坏的；不友善的；刻薄的；讨厌的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79310\"><ruby>友達<rp>(</rp><rt>ともだち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>意地悪<rp>(</rp><rt>いじわる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしてはいけません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不要欺骗朋友。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">椅子；座椅；凳子；长凳；职位；职务；席位；官职</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202860\">ちょっと<ruby>椅子<rp>(</rp><rt>いす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をずらしてくれない？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你会把椅子放在我身上吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">泉</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いずみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">泉；喷泉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141228\"><ruby>泉<rp>(</rp><rt>いずみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はおよそ１７０フィートの<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さまで<ruby>温水<rp>(</rp><rt>おんすい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>