b/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">依存；依赖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205489\">それはすべて<ruby>天候<rp>(</rp><rt>てんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>依存<rp>(</rp><rt>いぞん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这一切都取决于天气。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">板</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いた</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">板；木板；金属板；玻璃板；玻璃窗格；石板；砧板；菜板；（高级日料）厨师；料理人；舞台；戏台</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220451\">この<ruby>鉄<rp>(</rp><rt>てつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>板<rp>(</rp><rt>いた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすずでメッキしてある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个铁板是很干净的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">痛い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いたい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">疼痛；酸痛；令人尴尬的；难为情的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196436\">ほかに<ruby>痛<rp>(</rp><rt>いた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いところはありますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">还有别的痛苦吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">委託</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いたく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">委托；寄售；托付；信任；委任</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data